WEBVTT

01:54.350 --> 01:55.039
How is it?

02:03.920 --> 02:04.920
I know

02:07.040 --> 02:08.900
it probably can't be detoxified.

02:11.120 --> 02:13.190
I just wanted to give it a try.

02:15.030 --> 02:16.150
It's my fault.

02:18.840 --> 02:21.430
You gave me the dragon scale to save me.

02:25.000 --> 02:25.960
Silly.

02:26.960 --> 02:28.430
I'm glad to be able to

02:28.840 --> 02:29.800
save you.

02:31.400 --> 02:32.360
If I die,

02:32.520 --> 02:34.750
there will be another Baize Goddess.

02:36.120 --> 02:37.230
But Jiu…

02:38.630 --> 02:40.490
There's only one Jiu in the world.

02:43.280 --> 02:44.079
But

02:46.030 --> 02:47.000
in this world,

02:49.520 --> 02:51.250
there's also only one Wen Xiao.

03:18.960 --> 03:19.800
I'm sorry.

03:46.520 --> 03:47.470
Goddess,

03:47.750 --> 03:48.470
Mr. Zhao,

03:48.910 --> 03:50.110
Tiandu is in trouble.

03:56.190 --> 03:57.920
Why is there a plague suddenly?

03:59.240 --> 04:00.560
The plague is fierce.

04:01.430 --> 04:02.840
The physicians in Tiandu

04:03.120 --> 04:04.240
are all helpless.

04:06.360 --> 04:07.960
Could it be caused by a demon?

04:09.080 --> 04:09.960
King Xiang

04:10.560 --> 04:12.960
will definitely put pressure on my father.

04:12.960 --> 04:14.960
That's what I wanted to tell you too.

04:15.120 --> 04:16.040
Mr. Fan

04:17.390 --> 04:18.190
is missing.

04:23.510 --> 04:24.040
Father!

04:24.160 --> 04:24.800
It's me.

04:25.190 --> 04:25.920
Jiu.

04:25.920 --> 04:26.800
Don't come in.

04:27.560 --> 04:28.690
I've been infected.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.830
It's contagious.

04:30.430 --> 04:32.040
Everyone in Tiandu

04:32.360 --> 04:33.920
has probably been infected.

04:33.920 --> 04:35.320
The origin of this plague

04:36.000 --> 04:38.159
was a child of an ordinary family.

04:38.560 --> 04:40.560
Unexpectedly, it to spread so fast.

04:50.720 --> 04:52.190
I suspect this sachet

04:53.070 --> 04:55.310
might be the source of the plague.

04:58.560 --> 04:59.560
It's demon blood.

05:01.160 --> 05:01.950
Demon blood?

05:03.630 --> 05:04.830
Which demon's blood?

05:06.750 --> 05:08.800
A demon that we are familiar with.

05:12.000 --> 05:12.720
Fei.

05:15.360 --> 05:16.310
Fei?

05:17.560 --> 05:18.630
Isn't he dead?

05:19.630 --> 05:20.160
It's...

05:20.270 --> 05:21.310
It's this sachet.

05:23.160 --> 05:23.870
Sister Pei.

05:24.240 --> 05:24.920
Brother Zhuo.

05:24.920 --> 05:26.310
Step back a little.

05:27.070 --> 05:27.680
Step back.

05:31.560 --> 05:32.360
Good.

05:32.680 --> 05:33.680
The city

05:33.830 --> 05:35.560
is full of infected civilians.

05:36.310 --> 05:37.430
We are in the city.

05:37.830 --> 05:38.830
We can't avoid it.

05:39.920 --> 05:41.580
It'll happen sooner or later.

05:42.070 --> 05:42.830
Jiu,

05:43.360 --> 05:44.560
do you have any ideas?

05:46.510 --> 05:48.560
I need to study this.

06:33.560 --> 06:34.390
Are you okay?

06:35.830 --> 06:37.120
I can hold on.

06:39.000 --> 06:39.870
But

06:40.480 --> 06:41.600
I haven't detected

06:41.630 --> 06:44.000
the energy of any demons in Tiandu.

06:45.870 --> 06:47.600
Not even Fei's demonic energy.

06:49.750 --> 06:51.190
That's even stranger.

07:29.040 --> 07:29.840
Brother Zhuo?

07:39.830 --> 07:40.630
They said

07:40.950 --> 07:42.270
you stayed here all day

07:43.390 --> 07:44.720
and haven't even eaten.

07:45.720 --> 07:46.580
I'm not hungry.

07:47.600 --> 07:48.730
Time is running out.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.040
For a long time

07:52.720 --> 07:54.580
after my father and brother died,

07:55.630 --> 07:56.430
I was the same.

07:57.870 --> 07:58.510
Anxious.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.510
Worried.

08:01.870 --> 08:04.400
It always felt like there wasn't enough time.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.510
Mr. Zhuo.

08:07.950 --> 08:08.830
Actually,

08:10.510 --> 08:11.870
I'm a little scared.

08:20.040 --> 08:21.270
Hold this.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.360
Tell me

08:24.920 --> 08:25.980
why you're scared.

08:26.950 --> 08:28.190
Before,

08:28.630 --> 08:29.600
I always thought

08:29.920 --> 08:30.950
that my dad

08:31.430 --> 08:32.429
killed my mom.

08:33.750 --> 08:35.480
That's why I ran away from home.

08:37.390 --> 08:39.520
I don't remember much about my father.

08:41.030 --> 08:42.600
Every time I thought of him,

08:43.870 --> 08:45.390
I would drown in hatred.

08:49.550 --> 08:50.750
Familial love

08:51.630 --> 08:53.090
is deep within one's body.

08:55.200 --> 08:56.510
Time and distance

08:57.390 --> 08:59.390
can never wipe away its existence.

09:01.750 --> 09:02.720
Do you remember

09:02.910 --> 09:04.000
how I told you

09:04.120 --> 09:05.840
I like the smell of herbs?

09:06.600 --> 09:08.040
Of course I remember.

09:08.630 --> 09:10.510
I was very happy then,

09:11.000 --> 09:13.600
because I've been dealing with herbs since I was a kid.

09:13.600 --> 09:14.930
Actually, it's because

09:15.000 --> 09:16.790
my mother died from sickness

09:17.630 --> 09:18.890
when I was very little.

09:20.870 --> 09:22.080
My memories of her

09:22.390 --> 09:23.440
have blurred too.

09:25.080 --> 09:27.610
But I still remember the smell of herbs on her.

09:29.360 --> 09:31.620
Whenever I smelled the herbs after that,

09:33.030 --> 09:34.360
it felt like

09:35.080 --> 09:36.810
my mother was still holding me.

09:43.870 --> 09:44.670
I see.

09:46.150 --> 09:47.030
It's like how

09:47.150 --> 09:49.150
every time I eat almond buttermilk,

09:49.600 --> 09:50.790
I think of my mother.

09:51.960 --> 09:53.790
Every time I eat delicious food,

09:55.200 --> 09:56.320
I think of Ying Lei.

09:57.910 --> 09:59.590
Every time I hear a bell,

10:01.720 --> 10:03.120
I think of you, Mr. Zhuo.

10:10.960 --> 10:11.670
But

10:12.600 --> 10:14.510
I haven't sat down with Daddy

10:14.510 --> 10:15.840
and had a proper meal yet

10:16.150 --> 10:17.200
and clear up

10:17.470 --> 10:18.800
the misunderstanding.

10:22.750 --> 10:23.360
Jiu,

10:23.910 --> 10:25.030
you have to believe

10:26.200 --> 10:27.330
that you can cure it.

10:29.000 --> 10:30.130
There's still time.

10:39.840 --> 10:41.270
But I have no more.

10:45.550 --> 10:46.840
Mr. Zhuo.

10:48.910 --> 10:51.120
You must miss your brother and father

10:51.790 --> 10:52.920
frequently, right?

10:54.240 --> 10:54.790
Yes.

10:56.120 --> 10:57.150
My brother

10:57.630 --> 10:59.120
was an amazing person.

11:00.390 --> 11:01.670
I admired them

11:02.270 --> 11:04.070
and I wanted to become like them.

11:06.320 --> 11:07.840
Mr. Zhuo.

11:09.630 --> 11:11.430
I want to be someone like you too.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.770
What kind of person am I?

11:16.360 --> 11:17.150
At least...

11:19.600 --> 11:21.860
At least someone who's not timid like me,

11:22.840 --> 11:23.990
only daring to

11:25.000 --> 11:27.060
move forward by holding onto the bell

11:29.000 --> 11:30.800
hanging from someone's ribbon.

11:32.320 --> 11:33.240
Since young,

11:36.550 --> 11:38.390
I always wanted to be an older brother

11:38.390 --> 11:39.520
and protect others.

11:41.030 --> 11:42.390
I never did it.

11:45.080 --> 11:46.320
But your appearance

11:48.120 --> 11:49.240
helped me do it.

11:52.550 --> 11:53.280
You turned me

11:54.080 --> 11:55.340
into an older brother.

12:09.600 --> 12:10.480
Mr. Zhuo,

12:11.240 --> 12:13.480
you love your father and brother so much.

12:13.480 --> 12:15.360
How did you survive it?

12:16.600 --> 12:17.930
After they passed away,

12:19.440 --> 12:21.480
I was depressed for a long time.

12:22.790 --> 12:23.790
Later,

12:25.270 --> 12:26.270
I met someone.

12:31.600 --> 12:32.390
She said

12:33.720 --> 12:35.450
she hoped I wouldn't be worried

12:37.200 --> 12:38.860
and won't indulge in sadness.

12:39.630 --> 12:42.030
I hope you won't indulge in sadness

12:42.030 --> 12:43.080
anymore.

12:48.360 --> 12:49.120
She grew up

12:49.320 --> 12:50.270
with me.

12:52.320 --> 12:53.080
Slowly,

12:53.480 --> 12:54.320
I healed.

12:56.510 --> 12:57.750
Are you talking about

12:58.080 --> 12:59.270
Wen?

13:06.630 --> 13:07.960
Brother Zhuo,

13:08.960 --> 13:10.080
you love

13:10.080 --> 13:10.910
Wen,

13:11.480 --> 13:12.150
right?

13:14.960 --> 13:16.390
Why don't you tell her?

13:20.400 --> 13:22.000
There are many kinds of love.

13:24.000 --> 13:25.440
People like roses.

13:26.600 --> 13:27.930
When they pass by a rose,

13:28.150 --> 13:29.320
they'll praise it.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.060
"So fragrant."

13:31.750 --> 13:32.680
"So beautiful."

13:34.240 --> 13:35.480
Then they'll pick it

13:35.870 --> 13:37.330
and place it in their hair,

13:37.960 --> 13:38.910
on their sleeve.

13:40.600 --> 13:41.910
When others see it,

13:43.320 --> 13:44.630
they all feel envious.

13:47.960 --> 13:49.440
Do you think this is love?

13:51.270 --> 13:52.120
It is.

13:54.070 --> 13:55.930
But there's another kind of love,

13:57.600 --> 13:58.390
which is

13:58.670 --> 14:00.080
watering it every day,

14:01.240 --> 14:02.300
removing insects,

14:04.910 --> 14:06.550
watching it flourish

14:08.030 --> 14:09.000
and sway

14:09.040 --> 14:10.360
in the wind,

14:11.390 --> 14:13.320
becoming more and more beautiful.

14:18.840 --> 14:19.640
Brother Zhuo,

14:21.360 --> 14:22.870
why do I feel like

14:23.270 --> 14:24.270
the second type

14:26.750 --> 14:27.910
is more loving

14:29.360 --> 14:30.490
than the first kind?

14:32.600 --> 14:33.860
Because the second one

14:34.270 --> 14:35.480
is actually...

14:38.670 --> 14:39.480
What is it?

14:43.870 --> 14:44.960
Actually...

14:47.630 --> 14:49.560
I don't really understand either.

14:57.360 --> 14:58.150
Then,

15:00.360 --> 15:02.320
I feel even more sorry toward you.

15:05.960 --> 15:07.120
In order to save me,

15:09.150 --> 15:10.240
Wen's poison…

15:14.840 --> 15:15.870
Did she blame you?

15:16.390 --> 15:17.270
Of course not.

15:18.320 --> 15:19.150
She said

15:20.360 --> 15:21.600
it's not my fault.

15:23.030 --> 15:24.690
Then you should listen to her.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.030
Because

15:27.910 --> 15:29.110
I also listened to her

15:29.320 --> 15:30.320
when I was little.

15:38.120 --> 15:38.910
Okay.

15:40.550 --> 15:42.080
Are you still going to read?

15:42.630 --> 15:43.440
Yes.

15:44.080 --> 15:44.870
Okay.

15:45.480 --> 15:47.410
I'll stay with you for a while more.

16:10.910 --> 16:12.240
The fog is heavy at night.

16:12.240 --> 16:13.500
It's cold by the water.

16:15.600 --> 16:16.630
Put on a coat.

16:31.910 --> 16:32.960
There's no need

16:34.870 --> 16:36.330
to act tough in front of me.

16:41.360 --> 16:43.440
Actually, I got used to the pain.

16:45.480 --> 16:46.720
You are a great demon.

16:47.840 --> 16:48.750
Why are you

16:49.390 --> 16:50.440
so attentive?

16:54.200 --> 16:56.200
Great Demons are naturally casual,

16:57.030 --> 16:58.030
but with you,

16:59.000 --> 17:00.930
I'm extraordinarily thoughtful.

17:09.680 --> 17:10.589
My godfather

17:11.960 --> 17:13.069
is renowned.

17:15.440 --> 17:17.720
They all think he is decisive.

17:18.440 --> 17:19.240
Xiao.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.000
Father.

17:22.480 --> 17:23.940
You always lose your pens.

17:24.510 --> 17:25.349
I asked someone...

17:25.349 --> 17:26.200
But actually...

17:26.200 --> 17:28.109
To make these pens just for you.

17:28.240 --> 17:29.720
He is gentle, kind

17:30.110 --> 17:31.350
and thoughtful.

17:32.510 --> 17:34.880
He is really a good father.

17:35.750 --> 17:36.750
But now,

17:38.680 --> 17:40.000
he's alone

17:40.400 --> 17:41.730
and somewhere unknown.

17:44.720 --> 17:46.320
Yet there's nothing I can do.

17:48.270 --> 17:49.070
Don't worry.

17:51.270 --> 17:53.310
Mr. Fan is my future father too.

17:55.000 --> 17:56.160
I'm waiting

17:57.590 --> 17:58.920
to find Mr. Fan

18:00.790 --> 18:01.720
and then I can…

18:06.030 --> 18:06.920
What?

18:32.030 --> 18:33.490
Return to the Wilderness.

20:30.550 --> 20:31.200
I got it!

20:31.400 --> 20:32.460
I got the solution.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.160
I got it!

20:40.550 --> 20:41.550
Paralysis fruit?

20:41.590 --> 20:42.240
Yes.

20:42.920 --> 20:43.640
Since the plague

20:43.640 --> 20:44.970
is spread by fragrance,

20:45.400 --> 20:46.640
then let's seal off our sense of smell

20:46.640 --> 20:47.880
and cut off our breathing.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.030
This will work.

20:49.590 --> 20:50.790
This paralysis fruit

20:51.030 --> 20:52.270
was the herb you used

20:52.270 --> 20:54.680
to seal Zhao Yuanzhou's five senses before.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.200
Yes.

20:56.000 --> 20:57.830
My master developed it himself.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.720
It's even effective for great demons like Zhao Yuanzhou.

21:00.720 --> 21:01.400
It must

21:01.590 --> 21:02.720
also work on humans.

21:03.880 --> 21:04.920
Sealing the sense of smell

21:04.920 --> 21:05.880
is just the first step.

21:05.880 --> 21:06.790
We need to add

21:06.790 --> 21:08.250
wood that repels diseases

21:08.750 --> 21:10.750
to cure the plague from Fei's blood.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.090
You've worked hard.

21:30.640 --> 21:31.270
Fall.

21:49.070 --> 21:50.510
The ingrdients are all set.

21:50.510 --> 21:51.240
Watch me.

21:51.510 --> 21:52.030
Okay.

22:14.790 --> 22:16.850
I know there's a plague in the Tiandu.

22:17.070 --> 22:18.350
If you need it,

22:18.640 --> 22:20.440
you can summon me with this bead.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.500
Thank you, Ms. Wen.

22:24.640 --> 22:26.280
Remember to take the medicine.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.810
Not only should you take it,

22:27.920 --> 22:29.640
but also inform your neighbors,

22:29.640 --> 22:30.680
friends, and families.

22:30.680 --> 22:32.880
Have them all come and get the medicine.

22:38.030 --> 22:39.890
Where are Wen Xiao and the others?

22:40.070 --> 22:41.270
They sneaked out

22:41.270 --> 22:42.200
to Chongwu Camp.

22:44.720 --> 22:45.920
Fortunately, Sister Pei knows

22:45.920 --> 22:47.850
when Chongwu Camp changes shifts.

22:48.030 --> 22:49.760
Otherwise, we’d be in trouble.

22:50.000 --> 22:52.330
Why can’t the Baize Token find this place?

22:54.720 --> 22:57.480
There are talismans with Zhu Jian's blood in this secret room.

22:57.480 --> 22:59.280
It can block the demonic energy,

22:59.720 --> 23:01.320
so I decided to take a gamble.

23:03.160 --> 23:04.440
Fei should be here.

23:05.720 --> 23:06.510
Yes.

23:07.550 --> 23:08.350
Here.

23:08.720 --> 23:09.240
Yes.

23:25.790 --> 23:26.590
Fei.

23:28.310 --> 23:29.830
Isn’t Fei dead?

23:38.720 --> 23:39.680
It really is Fei.

23:46.350 --> 23:47.070
Mr. Fan.

23:49.550 --> 23:50.350
Zhuo—

24:17.030 --> 24:17.270
Wen Xiao!

24:17.270 --> 24:17.830
Father!

24:18.880 --> 24:19.680
Father!

24:20.550 --> 24:21.200
Father!

24:23.680 --> 24:24.310
Let's go.

24:29.350 --> 24:29.880
Wait.

24:33.200 --> 24:34.310
There an inner core

24:36.000 --> 24:37.000
in Mr. Fan's body.

24:39.320 --> 24:41.180
How can a human have an inner core?

24:42.400 --> 24:44.030
Because I finally created

24:44.030 --> 24:45.480
a real demonized human.

25:13.030 --> 25:14.890
As expected, you're still alive.

25:18.480 --> 25:19.880
Instead of being a human,

25:20.830 --> 25:23.630
why did you turn yourself into this demonic thing?

25:26.750 --> 25:28.200
This is a true rebirth.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.640
Phoenix.

25:54.270 --> 25:56.480
Looks like you are really smart.

26:00.160 --> 26:02.620
Princess Longyu gave you the Phoenix Pearl.

26:04.110 --> 26:05.910
You swallowed the Phoenix Pearl

26:06.440 --> 26:08.350
and turned yourself into a demonized human.

26:08.350 --> 26:10.280
I've always had the Phoenix Pearl.

26:11.350 --> 26:13.350
That's why you tried so hard

26:14.720 --> 26:16.650
to get Zhao Yuanzhou's inner core.

26:18.270 --> 26:19.070
The inner core

26:21.240 --> 26:23.640
had the Ever-Burning Wood that you wanted.

26:32.510 --> 26:33.370
Zhao Yuanzhou,

26:35.270 --> 26:36.640
in the end,

26:37.270 --> 26:39.670
the heavens made you repay what you owed me.

26:41.270 --> 26:44.270
Not only do I possess the demonic power of Phoenix now,

26:44.960 --> 26:47.760
but I also have the power of the Ever-Burning Wood.

26:58.600 --> 26:59.400
Sir!

27:02.830 --> 27:03.960
You're still alive.

27:06.310 --> 27:08.710
Our great mission is about to be completed.

27:10.590 --> 27:11.590
If you swallow it,

27:12.350 --> 27:14.410
you will be transformed completely.

27:19.510 --> 27:22.040
Now, I have the fire of the Ever-Burning Wood.

27:22.960 --> 27:24.760
I can create demon cores myself.

27:26.160 --> 27:26.870
Soon,

27:28.160 --> 27:31.070
I will have a perfect team of demonized humans.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.030
Dream on.

27:35.160 --> 27:35.790
Today,

27:36.680 --> 27:38.010
I won't let you succeed!

27:46.200 --> 27:48.060
Unfortunately, I've succeeded.

27:49.030 --> 27:50.590
And it was all thanks to you.

27:52.070 --> 27:52.960
Just now,

27:54.070 --> 27:56.530
you personally gave the demon core I created

27:57.110 --> 27:59.440
to all the people in the city.

28:00.400 --> 28:01.330
After tomorrow,

28:02.590 --> 28:03.590
everyone

28:04.790 --> 28:07.590
will gradually transform into demonized humans.

28:15.510 --> 28:16.970
It's the paralysis fruit.

28:19.110 --> 28:20.680
You're still using Bai Jiu.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.160
Wen Zongyu,

28:23.240 --> 28:24.640
you hate demons so much,

28:25.240 --> 28:26.880
but now you chose to be a demon.

28:26.880 --> 28:28.080
Isn't it ridiculous?

28:28.160 --> 28:29.220
You're a demon too.

28:30.270 --> 28:32.270
Don't you think you're ridiculous?

28:33.880 --> 28:35.940
The demons hurt my beloved wife first

28:36.350 --> 28:38.810
and then killed my wife, child, and brother.

28:39.070 --> 28:41.750
The tragedies in the mortal world are all caused by demons.

28:41.750 --> 28:42.830
So I want to kill demons.

28:42.830 --> 28:44.890
I want to kill all demons in the world!

28:47.240 --> 28:49.640
But as a human, I was born with little power.

28:50.550 --> 28:52.440
That's why I must fight for the rest of my life

28:52.440 --> 28:54.030
to create a power that is stronger

28:54.030 --> 28:55.890
and more invincible than demons.

28:56.790 --> 28:59.190
Your loved ones were also killed by demons.

28:59.830 --> 29:01.430
Why don't you understand me?

29:02.480 --> 29:03.410
Understand you?

29:04.510 --> 29:07.160
You disregarded the wishes of the city's people

29:07.160 --> 29:08.640
and turned them into mindless, half-demon

29:08.640 --> 29:10.200
and half-human creatures.

29:10.750 --> 29:12.750
Yet you expect us to understand you?

29:14.640 --> 29:16.500
I'm doing this for their own good.

29:17.960 --> 29:19.790
Demonized humans have no pain

29:21.070 --> 29:22.200
and no worries.

29:23.480 --> 29:25.410
They only have powerful strength.

29:26.400 --> 29:28.640
I'll lead them to kill all the evil monsters,

29:28.640 --> 29:30.040
flatten the Wilderness,

29:31.720 --> 29:33.510
and create a new world.

29:35.240 --> 29:35.770
Wen Xiao,

29:36.030 --> 29:37.490
quickly take Mr. Fan away.

29:41.310 --> 29:42.770
It's the same trick again.

29:43.720 --> 29:45.320
You can only run away, right?

29:56.350 --> 29:57.030
Sir!

30:56.920 --> 30:58.050
The phoenix's power

30:58.110 --> 30:59.270
can control the karmic fire.

30:59.270 --> 31:01.130
The phoenix has an immortal body.

31:01.680 --> 31:02.940
It is reborn from fire.

31:03.590 --> 31:04.510
The greater the karmic fire,

31:04.510 --> 31:06.440
the stronger his spiritual energy is.

31:06.440 --> 31:07.500
We can't defeat him

31:08.160 --> 31:09.240
in the fire.

31:09.790 --> 31:10.880
That's why I brought him

31:10.880 --> 31:12.510
to the icy Mount Kunlun.

31:13.000 --> 31:15.200
The demonic power of Bingyi Clan is best at manipulating ice and snow.

31:15.200 --> 31:16.480
It happens to be the nemesis of karmic fire.

31:16.480 --> 31:17.030
Zhuo,

31:17.720 --> 31:18.590
do as I say.

31:21.750 --> 31:23.410
Since the sword is has a shape,

31:26.160 --> 31:28.020
flowing water will be traceless.

31:29.200 --> 31:31.060
Flowing water will be traceless.

31:31.200 --> 31:32.530
The origin is formless.

31:32.830 --> 31:34.160
The origin is formless.

31:34.880 --> 31:36.280
It is born from a thought.

31:36.350 --> 31:37.750
It is born from a thought.

32:06.440 --> 32:07.100
This smoke!

32:11.440 --> 32:12.640
It seems to be poisonous.

32:12.640 --> 32:13.440
Seal.

32:14.480 --> 32:15.160
Zhuo!

32:57.200 --> 32:58.110
Zhao Yuanzhou.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.270
Zhao Yuanzhou.

33:04.750 --> 33:06.920
Your new home is really interesting.

33:07.110 --> 33:08.970
Why didn't you invite me earlier?

33:31.550 --> 33:32.350
Zhu Yan.

33:33.480 --> 33:34.640
Long time no see.

33:35.920 --> 33:37.110
Want a drink?

33:47.550 --> 33:48.350
Brother Zhuo!

33:48.920 --> 33:49.450
Let's go.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.210
Let's drink.

33:54.750 --> 33:55.640
There's wine here.

33:55.640 --> 33:56.000
Here.

33:56.960 --> 33:57.960
Kids can't dirnk.

33:59.160 --> 34:00.020
You drink this.

34:00.510 --> 34:01.790
Almond buttermilk.

34:10.280 --> 34:10.920
Jiu.

34:11.550 --> 34:12.510
Didn't you say

34:13.070 --> 34:15.150
you regret not cherishing that time?

34:16.190 --> 34:17.650
Why are you still unhappy?

34:21.400 --> 34:22.330
Look carefully.

34:31.440 --> 34:32.370
Let me try again.

34:33.670 --> 34:34.880
You hurt your hand.

34:35.440 --> 34:36.670
Let's call it a day.

34:37.480 --> 34:38.710
It's just a minor injury.

34:38.710 --> 34:39.670
I'm a man.

34:40.080 --> 34:41.030
I can continue.

34:41.880 --> 34:43.540
We have the future ahead of us.

34:43.670 --> 34:45.480
I will teach you archery well.

34:46.110 --> 34:47.400
There's no rush.

34:48.630 --> 34:49.489
Zhao Yuanzhou.

34:51.150 --> 34:52.110
Long time no see.

34:54.960 --> 34:56.219
When old friends meet,

34:57.510 --> 34:58.790
we should drink more.

35:04.920 --> 35:05.710
Great Demon.

35:07.550 --> 35:08.880
Why are you spacing out?

35:09.110 --> 35:10.800
Come and push the swing for me.

35:32.630 --> 35:33.670
Great Demon,

35:34.320 --> 35:35.710
just help me

35:35.710 --> 35:37.570
push the swing like this forever,

35:37.960 --> 35:38.800
okay?

35:43.510 --> 35:44.510
Okay.

35:45.110 --> 35:47.280
Stay here with me forever.

35:50.400 --> 35:51.480
Look,

35:52.230 --> 35:53.960
everyone is so happy right now.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.360
Didn't you say

36:17.440 --> 36:19.300
you don't like pushing the swing?

36:21.320 --> 36:22.840
If it's for someone I love,

36:24.320 --> 36:26.250
I can push it for the rest of my life.

36:28.800 --> 36:31.260
It would be great if we really could stay here

36:32.800 --> 36:33.660
for a lifetime.

36:37.000 --> 36:37.880
But you know

36:39.480 --> 36:40.590
it's impossible.

36:42.030 --> 36:43.320
Of course I know.

36:44.920 --> 36:45.720
It's just that

36:47.440 --> 36:50.170
I want to consciously be delusional for a moment.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.190
It's a dream.

37:13.590 --> 37:16.510
It should be the Poison of Indulgence in Wen Zongyu's fire.

37:16.510 --> 37:17.770
Poison of Indulgence?

37:18.320 --> 37:18.920
Yes.

37:21.400 --> 37:23.130
It's similar to Ran Yi's dream.

37:24.280 --> 37:26.440
This poison will arouse the greatest desire

37:26.440 --> 37:27.670
in our hearts,

37:29.230 --> 37:30.840
and make us indulge in it,

37:32.280 --> 37:34.710
trapped in this endless dream.

37:36.670 --> 37:38.400
How can we wake up?

37:40.280 --> 37:41.320
Do you remember

37:43.070 --> 37:44.800
the solution to Ran Yi's dream?

37:49.000 --> 37:49.800
Yes.

38:06.920 --> 38:07.720
What's wrong?

38:24.550 --> 38:25.360
What if...

38:28.000 --> 38:29.110
this isn't a dream?

38:30.710 --> 38:33.070
Zhao Wan'er and Li Lun have long died.

38:34.840 --> 38:36.670
How can this not be a dream?

38:40.710 --> 38:41.710
Zhao Yuanzhou.

38:42.110 --> 38:43.190
Wake up!

39:09.230 --> 39:09.800
Brother Zhuo!

39:09.800 --> 39:10.530
Great Demon!

39:11.630 --> 39:12.150
Jiu?

39:12.400 --> 39:13.330
Why are you here?

39:13.510 --> 39:14.760
I went to Chongwu Camp to find you all.

39:14.760 --> 39:15.960
I heard you were here.

39:16.150 --> 39:17.710
You're the one who detoxified us.

39:17.710 --> 39:18.110
Yes.

39:18.510 --> 39:19.970
Luckily I arrived in time.

39:20.190 --> 39:20.840
Bai Jiu.

39:22.920 --> 39:24.550
Are you going to fight me too?

39:25.070 --> 39:26.800
I know it's beyond my abilities,

39:26.800 --> 39:27.510
but I have to

39:27.510 --> 39:29.000
stand with my friends.

39:55.320 --> 39:56.150
Ridiculous.

39:57.000 --> 39:59.280
You don't have much demonic power left.

39:59.710 --> 40:02.510
It's useless like an insect trying to shake a tree.

40:32.840 --> 40:34.840
The inner core is not in his stomach.

40:35.000 --> 40:37.110
He hid the inner core somewhere else.

40:37.110 --> 40:38.110
What should we do?

40:38.190 --> 40:39.000
Only the Truth Eye

40:39.000 --> 40:41.200
or the Golden Pupils of Baize can see it.

40:41.510 --> 40:42.110
Wen Xiao.
